      "title": "Superconductivity at 93 K in a new mixed-phase Y-Ba-Cu-O compound system at ambient pressure",
      "abstract": "A stable and reproducible superconductivity transition between 80 and 93 K has been unambiguously observed both resistively and magnetically in a new Y-Ba-Cu-O compound system at ambient pressure. An estimated upper critical field ${\\mathrm{H}}_{\\mathrm{c}2}$(0) between 80 and 180 T was obtained.",
